\begin{slide}
Combat Talon I Kalman Filter Code Structure
\begin{itemize}
  \item Separate tasks and real-time execs for each rate group
	\begin{itemize}
		\item .1 Hz $\Rightarrow$ REP005HZ $\Rightarrow$  KF'NAV'05'HERTZ'EXEC
		\item 1 Hz $\Rightarrow$ REP1HZ $\Rightarrow$ KF'NAV'1'HERTZ'EXEC
		\item 4 Hz $\Rightarrow$ REP4HZ $\Rightarrow$ KF'NAV'4'HERTZ'EXEC
		\item 8 Hz $\Rightarrow$ REP8HZ $\Rightarrow$ KF'NAV'8'HERTZ'EXEC
		\item 16 Hz $\Rightarrow$ REP16HZ $\Rightarrow$ KF'NAV'16'HERTZ'EXEC
	\end{itemize}
\end{itemize} 
\end{slide}
